{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "doomsday-blog",
  "name": "Doomsday Blog",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Doomsday_Blog",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-02T09:05:40.465Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Real-time transcribed voice posts, with missing content due to unstable signals and massive ▄noise▀▄ interference."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-81e409e382b44461"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Posted in Dovebrook District\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I apologize for taking up public space like this. Truly, I do. But as a beloved idol, there's just something I have to get off my chest today:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My dear fans, you are more than welcome to love me, but please, do NOT let that love become a burden on public order and social harmony!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I just wrapped filming on"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Great Detective Who Can't Catch a Break"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "today, and what did I find waiting for me outside the set? A group of mechatron fans who had completely lost it, going on an absolute frenzy and unleashing their \"Windmill Defacer\" punches on other fans left and right, injuring many people."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This is completely and utterly unacceptable!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Love freely, but don't cause harm. Don't let your love for me go to your head!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b5f53258a76cb5b3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh, and one more thing. The night sky looks weird today. Guys, get home early and let me know you're safe."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-683a7cef3197acda"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Attached below is a nine-grid photo of a ploo, flashing a glamorous smile. Hanging ominously behind that confident smile is a wicked, grinning Phantasmoon."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dafedf290f0d9afb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Posted in Dovebrook District\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Everyone, stay calm! This is all just acting! Acting!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Some visionary director must be trying to capture the raw terror on people's faces when confronted with death, and transformed all of Dovebrook into a doomsday film set."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've spent years playing dead and have mastered hundreds of ways to die, so let me give you all a little demonstration."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "First, close your eyes, pick a pose, then lie flat just like I'm doing right now..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "All we have to do is wait for the director to yell \"cut!\" and then it'll all be over!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-22daab35383d0a3c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Darn it, why hasn't that stupid director called \"cut\" yet?!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That unhinged orch is about to throw a ██▄▄▀▄living▄▄▀ child into Dovebrook!!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-73635e3b746087fe"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Posted in Dovebrook District\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It's real. It's real. It's real. IT'S REAL..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I hurt someone..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That orch... I had no choice but to push him into Dovebrook."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If I kept playing dead, it would've been that kid who died!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry... This doesn't feel like acting anymore. My head's about to explode. I think I'm losing my mind!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3e63b9838c5b03f3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Posted in ▄▄\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What do I do now, my hands won't stop shaking."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I finally ran into a security officer a moment ago. He covered me and got me hidden inside a shop, then never came back."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "*Planarcadia profanity* What an idiot... O The Laughter, please watch over him."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c83f519eeaea91a7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Posted in Dovebrook District\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This place isn't safe anymore. Those frenzied imagenae have completely surrounded this little shop."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That poor door is going to get smashed to pieces any minute now."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Good thing it's just me in here."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d1f5328e64b09542"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Haha, all my life, I've been acting at being dead. And now, at last, I get to live the role."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Laughter above, this is the greatest joke of my life."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b729f597d1618c76"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Posted in ▀▄\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "SOS██▄▄▀▄▄▄▀"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "▄▄█▄▀██▄▀▄"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "▀██▄▄▄█▄"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3c749b80659b6608"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Posted at Perdido Station\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Friends, I'm alive! I'm actually still alive!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sorry for not responding sooner, I've been helping out at Perdido Station taking care of the wounded."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Turns out it wasn't frenzied imagenae that burst through the door. It was a talking monkey!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It came charging in holding a banana, and in a smooth, elegant baritone, it rallied us to grab spatulas, brooms, anything within reach, whatever could be used as a weapon to defend ourselves. It said, \"Stop playing dead. Stop lying down in resignation. Live... like a hero!\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3c374b8804a32901"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Friends, don't give up, don't give up! Aha is right here with us."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-015fb04d43c5e95c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If needed, please head to Perdido Station for shelter!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Share Location: Perdido Station\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c37d296baa427f1c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@Lone_Freerider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "has changed their name to"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "@StandFirmTogether"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8ee06050d2455097"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
